### API Call Comparison

**Per-Turn LLM (original plan):**
- 100 runs × 120 months × 4 turns/month × 20 agents = 9.6M calls
- 9.6M calls × 931 tokens (aligned) = 8.94B tokens
- **GPT-5-mini:** $2,235
