    34→
    35→1. **`/api/dashboard/agents`** - AI agent data (20 agents, NOT just first!)
    36→2. **`/api/dashboard/environment`** - Planetary boundaries, tipping points
    37→3. **`/api/dashboard/government`** - 30 countries, policies, tensions
